UID:ikaria-exo-plagia-panigiri-of-agios-kirykos-agia-ioulitta-exo-plagi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270715
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270716
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Kirykos & Agia Ioulitta\, Exo Plagia
LOCATION:Exo Plagia\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island capital's own feast\, for its patron saints Kirykos and Ioulitta — the warm-up to Ikaria's big mid-summer run. Tables fill the square\, the wine is from the barrel\, and the Ikariotiko dancing builds long past midnight.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#exo-plagia-panigiri-of-agios-kirykos-agia-ioulitta-exo-plagi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#exo-plagia-panigiri-of-agios-kirykos-agia-ioulitta-exo-plagi
END:VEVENT
