DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270720
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270721
SUMMARY:Plastic-free panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Vrakades
LOCATION:Vrakades\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Profitis Ilias always sits on a summit\, so these panigiria happen at hilltop chapels with the whole island spread out below and the dancing under the stars. Several villages celebrate the same night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#vrakades-plastic-free-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-vrakades
