UID:ikaria-karkinagri-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-karkinagri-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270725
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Karkinagri
LOCATION:Karkinagri\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:One of the season's busiest nights\, in several villages at once. The Ikarian formula in full: no stage\, no tickets — communal tables of goat in tomato sauce\, soufiko and kathoura cheese\, barrels of village wine\, and live violin-and-lute until dawn.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#karkinagri-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-karkinagri
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#karkinagri-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-karkinagri
END:VEVENT
