UID:ikaria-agios-panteleimonas-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-agios-pant-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Agios Panteleimonas (Agios Kirykos)
LOCATION:Agios Panteleimonas\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hamlet named after the saint\, just above Agios Kirykos\, hosts the feast on the evening of 26 July in the church courtyard\, and comes back on 27 August for Agios Fanourios with the Zelepos orchestra. Feidos (Evdilos side) and Myrsonas (Raches) keep Agios Panteleimon the same night. Easy one to reach from town by car or taxi.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#agios-panteleimonas-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-agios-pant
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#agios-panteleimonas-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-agios-pant
END:VEVENT
