LOCATION:Dafni\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Dafni\, a small mountain village inland from Evdilos\, celebrates on 4 August with a panigiri organised by its cultural association: roast goat\, mezedes and Ikarian wine\, with Nikos Fakaros's orchestra in 2025. Two days later the same village keeps the Transfiguration (6 August) alongside Christos Raches\, Frantato and Stavlos\, so it is a good base for a three-night run.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#dafni-panigiri-of-the-seven-youths-of-ephesus-dafni
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#dafni-panigiri-of-the-seven-youths-of-ephesus-dafni
