BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-frantato-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-frantato-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270806
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration\, Frantato
LOCATION:Frantato\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Frantato\, in the green interior between Evdilos and Raches\, throws its Sotiros panigiri on the evening of 6 August with the Zevkalides band\, the island's best-known young Ikarian ensemble. It is the panigiri locals from the Evdilos side choose over Christos Raches: smaller\, with goat and wine from the village association and dancing until daybreak. Stavlos\, a short drive away\, runs an all-day feast the same date.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#frantato-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-frantato
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#frantato-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-frantato
END:VEVENT
