DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270808
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270809
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Triantafyllos\, Mandria
LOCATION:Mandria\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:A small Raches-area village feast on 8 August\, with Nikos Fakaros and the Musicarous playing in 2026. Typical west-Ikaria format: tables in the square\, goat and wine from the association\, dancing well past midnight. Kossoikia (Evdilos side) keeps the same saint the same night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#mandria-panigiri-of-agios-triantafyllos-mandria
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#mandria-panigiri-of-agios-triantafyllos-mandria
