SUMMARY:Panigiri of Faros
LOCATION:Faros\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The beach village of Faros at the eastern tip\, next to the airport\, holds its panigiri on 10 August with the Ikariotiki Kompania. Handy if you are staying in Agios Kirykos or arriving by plane: flat\, by the sea\, easy parking along the beach road. Food and wine from the village association\, dancing till late.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#faros-panigiri-of-faros
