UID:ikaria-avlaki-fishermen-s-panigiri-psaropanigiro-avlaki-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270811
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270812
SUMMARY:Fishermen's panigiri (psaropanigiro)\, Avlaki
LOCATION:Avlaki\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The fishing hamlet of Avlaki near Karavostamo serves fish instead of goat at its psaropanigiro on the harbour. Sources disagree on the date: the 2026 island list gives 11 August (Agios Efplous / Agios Fanourios)\, while older lists put it on 27 August for Agios Fanourios\, so check the ikariaki.gr calendar in the week before. Either way it is small\, cheap and on the water.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#avlaki-fishermen-s-panigiri-psaropanigiro-avlaki
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#avlaki-fishermen-s-panigiri-psaropanigiro-avlaki
END:VEVENT
