BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-manganitis-summer-panigiri-of-manganitis-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270813
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270814
SUMMARY:Summer panigiri of Manganitis
LOCATION:Manganitis\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Manganitis\, the cliff-hung fishing village on the south coast reached through the tunnel road\, has its summer panigiri on 13 August\, run by the residents' association 'To Kavaki' (Nikos Fakaros's orchestra in 2019\, the Periichou ensemble with Panagiotis Choutras in 2026). It is not tied to a saint\, just the village's night: tables around the harbour\, island songs and dancing until late. Fles near Evdilos holds a wine feast the same night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#manganitis-summer-panigiri-of-manganitis
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#manganitis-summer-panigiri-of-manganitis
END:VEVENT
