BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-kampa-day-panigiri-of-the-dormition-kampa-xylosyrtis-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Day panigiri of the Dormition\, Kampa (Xylosyrtis)
LOCATION:Kampa\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kampa is the vineyard hamlet above Xylosyrtis under Mount Atheras\; its 15 August panigiri\, run by the Xylosyrtis association 'O Atheras'\, starts early afternoon with local food\, the area's own wine and a violin-led band (Giannis Roussos in 2026) and goes 'until the shoes melt'. A daytime option on the south side of the island\, 15 minutes from Agios Kirykos. Monokampi\, further along the same coast\, also does a midday-start panigiri this date.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#kampa-day-panigiri-of-the-dormition-kampa-xylosyrtis
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#kampa-day-panigiri-of-the-dormition-kampa-xylosyrtis
END:VEVENT
