BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-karavostamo-panigiri-of-the-dormition-karavostamo-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Karavostamo
LOCATION:Karavostamo\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The north coast's big 15 August\, held on the day in Karavostamo 'from early' with an Ikarian company (Marios and his group in 2024). Larger and more accessible than Langada\, on the main road between Evdilos and Agios Kirykos\, with the sea a few steps away for a swim between dances. Buses do not run late\; arrange a taxi or a sober driver.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#karavostamo-panigiri-of-the-dormition-karavostamo
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#karavostamo-panigiri-of-the-dormition-karavostamo
END:VEVENT
